  "prefLabel": "Nuh 102.03 Nursing home administrator",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nuh 102.03 \"Nursing home administrator\" means any individual who is charged with the general administration of a nursing home whether or not such individual has an ownership interest in such home and whether or not his functions and duties are shared with one or more other individuals.\n\nSource. #7592, eff 11-16-01",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/nuh100-500.html"
